# Cursor Rules — CuniSmart (MVP)

## Master sources of truth
- Always read `AGENTS.md` first.
- Use `agent_docs/` for detailed guidance:
  - `agent_docs/tech_stack.md`
  - `agent_docs/code_patterns.md`
  - `agent_docs/product_requirements.md`
  - `agent_docs/testing.md`

## Directives
- Plan first before editing multiple files.
- Build one MVP must-have feature at a time.
- Verify after each feature (tests + quick manual offline + accessibility check).
- Do not add features outside MVP scope.
- Do not change CI/deployment, migrations, or IoT protocol decisions without explicit approval.

